@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### 1. Health Check (Verify system status)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
Accept: application/json

###

### 2. Shorten a URL (Auto-generated Base62 shortId)
POST {{baseUrl}}/shorten
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "originalUrl": "https://github.com/trending"
}

###

### 3. Shorten a URL with Custom Alias
POST {{baseUrl}}/shorten
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "originalUrl": "https://news.ycombinator.com",
  "customAlias": "hn-news"
}

###

### 4. Shorten a URL with Expiration (TTL link)
POST {{baseUrl}}/shorten
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "originalUrl": "https://www.google.com",
  "expiresAt": "2027-12-31T23:59:59.000Z"
}

###

### 5. Shorten URL - Invalid URL format (Should return 400 Bad Request)
POST {{baseUrl}}/shorten
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "originalUrl": "invalid-url-string"
}

###

### 6. Shorten URL - Duplicate Custom Alias (Should return 409 Conflict)
POST {{baseUrl}}/shorten
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "originalUrl": "https://news.ycombinator.com",
  "customAlias": "hn-news"
}

###

### 7. Redirect Short URL (GET Redirect)
# Requesting this logs click metadata (IP, browser, device) asynchronously in the background.
# In VS Code REST Client, this returns the redirect target and response headers.
GET {{baseUrl}}/hn-news

###

### 8. Fetch Analytics Dashboard JSON (GET Analytics)
GET {{baseUrl}}/analytics/hn-news
Accept: application/json

###

### 9. Redirect Non-existent Short URL (Should return 404 Not Found)
GET {{baseUrl}}/does-not-exist

###

### 10. Fetch Analytics for Non-existent URL (Should return 404 Not Found)
GET {{baseUrl}}/analytics/does-not-exist

###

### 11. PUT request (Unsupported method - Should return 404 Route Not Found)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/hn-news
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "originalUrl": "https://news.ycombinator.com/news"
}

###

### 12. DELETE request (Unsupported method - Should return 404 Route Not Found)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/hn-news

###

### 13. PATCH request (Unsupported method - Should return 404 Route Not Found)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/hn-news
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "originalUrl": "https://news.ycombinator.com"
}
